WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.330
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.510
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.110
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.650
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.650
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.060
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.620
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:35.230
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.930
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.700
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.370
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.080
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.340
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.480
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.620
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.560
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.360
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.600
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:15.900
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.850
1963, Florida, America

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:50.270
What? Who are you?
Are you a soldier?

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.500
No, I am a general.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.850
Jesus!!

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.860
Six years later, 1969

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.620
We're at Kyoto Station already!
Saemi! Have you seen Kyoto Tower?!

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.960
You said the same thing
on the way there.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.760
Let's go to Kobe next time.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:55.200
I want to go to Kyushu!

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.130
Kyushu? Don't be cheap!

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.730
This time I'm going to
win us a trip overseas!

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.540
I'm the one who won
the tickets, remember?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.540
That's cold! Saemi, here!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.650
It's cool and refreshing!!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.990
Oh, dear.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.030
What's this?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.690
A ship is stuck into the ocean!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.260
<i>This is the Marine Surfer Queen.</i>

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.970
We have ascertained
that this cargo ship...

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.700
...disappeared in the vicinity
of the Bermuda Sea 6 years ago.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:38.770
6 years ago?
Then why is it in Japan?

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:44.080
This cargo ship passed through time
and space. We have no details, but...

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:50.280
Commander! Mysterious para-freqs
on the emergency channel!

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.380
They are trying to tune
the frequency against us.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.990
The output is 5,000 times normal!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.290
What does the message say?

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:03.930
Presently analyzing on Circuit 124875!
Analysis complete!

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.900
<i>Heil, Vader!</i>

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.740
That's the Kikai Shogun!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:14.370
Kikai...
Shogun?

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.680
Oh, my. ls this a friend
of yours, Commander?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.650
The Kikai Shogun: One of the
three top invader executives.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:27.490
By merging with various machines
and manipulating them at will...

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:32.790
...he has effectively intensified a
large number of disputes worldwide.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:39.500
However, how did he get past our tight
AEGIS surveillance network, to Japan?

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.400
I see! He used the cargo ship.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.010
<i>Human speed of thought
is definitely slow.</i>

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.340
What is your objective?!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.710
<i>A greeting.</i>

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.220
What?!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:57.120
As human etiquette demands,
to thank you for the privilege...

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.560
...of visiting your far east
island country, I give you this.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.160
Hey, isn't that
the bullet train Hikari?

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.750
This train will continue
to increase speed.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.780
Ultimately, it will
pass the speed of sound.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.410
What did you say?!

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:25.450
If it does...

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.080
...the last stop, Tokyo Station...

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.590
...will be destroyed!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:47.060
Holy cow! A flush toilet!
That's my super express dream train!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.480
Paper cups, paper CUPS!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.780
To commemorate the ride.
I'll get one for Saemi, too.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.750
<i>The next stop is Nagoya.
We are arriving at Nagoya.</i>

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.790
Wow, Nagoya...

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.850
<i>Attention, all passengers.
This bullet train Hikari,</i>

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:14.530
<i>New Osaka to Tokyo,
is now nonstop.</i>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.500
What's going on?

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.370
I need to get off at Nagoya!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.300
This is ridiculous!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.170
<i>Heil, Vader!</i>

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.080
<i>This junk-heap train,
so inferior to my country's E-79...</i>

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:33.020
<i>will now be remade into
a perfect robot-machine!'</i>

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:48.530
Ooh, intense, ya?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:55.030
Command authority over all affected
precincts is now delegated to AEGIS!

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:56.970
What about the emergency brakes?

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:01.600
No good, sir! ATC control from
signal 210 is being rejected!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.240
CTC, likewise!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.810
I thought so.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:10.380
All right, stop all bullet trains
in and out of Tokyo immediately.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:15.020
Contact each passenger station and
evacuate platforms of all personnel.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:19.000
Then we will begin an emergency control
operation to stop the bullet train robot.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.860
W-We have a problem, Commander!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.540
Is this true?!
Yes, sir!

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.470
What's wrong, sir?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:31.100
I have bad news. I'm told that
Captain Ukiya, who is on vacation...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.740
...is on board the bullet train
taken over by the Kikai Shogun.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.850
Ayaya!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.480
He is?!

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:44.080
At this rate, we'll hit something!
The back! Get to the back, quick!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.480
Hey. don't push!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:49.860
Good grief, he takes so
long in the bathroom!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.490
Has something happened?

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:54.930
I can't tell!
I think the brakes are broken!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:55.990
Big brother...

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:02.680
<i>This is Patrol 301!
Runaway train confirmed!</i>

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.300
<i>W- What's this?!</i>

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:10.550
<i>307, damaged'! Pursuit impossible/l
Pursuit impossible!</i>

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:16.340
Commander, Agent lkusawa and the Gate
Keepers have arrived at Tokyo Station.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.690
They are our last hope!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.430
Ayaya! ls this a steam engine?!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.940
It's quite a classic, isn't it...

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.210
It's wonderful.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:49.610
Is- ls this the pursuit
train AEGIS prepared for us?

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:55.690
It may appear old, but
this electric locomotive...

00:08:55.760 --> 00:09:00.060
...boasts a record speed
of 331 kilometers per hour!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:04.090
This is the BB-9004!

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:09.200
We borrowed it from AEGIS France
branch for data collection!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.040
Not only that! Look at this!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:28.420
What do you think?!
It even has a gate engine!

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:30.990
Yeah! Okay, let's go!

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.290
Roger, AEGIS!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.630
After chopper observation, we now
know that only the lead engine...

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:46.010
...is merged with the Kikai Shogun
and is completely robototized.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:51.350
Use Agent Konoe's Gate of Pursuit to
reduce the speed of the train-robot!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:58.020
Then sever the connector to the passenger
section with Agent Fei's Gate of Fire!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:02.320
Once the passengers are secured,
render the lead engine inoperable.

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:03.950
<i>Understood!</i>

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:07.860
After taking speed, terrain and
everything else into consideration...

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.230
...the intercept point is...

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.710
...Tama Riverl!

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:20.010
AEGIS home base! AEGIS home base!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:23.710
This is Shun Ukiya! This is Shun Ukiya!
Can you hear me?!

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.680
<i>HEIL VADER/</i>

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.170
Hold it right there!!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:48.760
<i>Accept this gift as a token
of my esteem, Shun Ukiya.</i>

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.140
How do you know my name?!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:08.120
<i>My name is Kikai Shogun!
You! Human with the name of Shun Ukiya!</i>

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.230
<i>If you wish to stop the train,
come to the engine room!</i>

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.950
How is it, Megane?

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:32.350
Just a little more!
ls everybody else ready?!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.680
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.090
Don't order me around
over every little thing.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:38.650
Yes, ma'am! Ready to go!!

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.690
Big Boss, you have the positive
and negative currents reversed!!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:50.230
I have the gate of power,
so I'm not cut out for science!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.060
Amazing! You're invincible, Bancho!!

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:01.410
Ukiya... Ukiya!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.980
Kaoru...

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:22.730
<i>Attack ability and energy reaction,
all within estimated range.</i>

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:26.100
<i>Probability of victory 87.6%.</i>

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:27.730
Damn it!!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.140
<i>Weapon code U-04.</i>

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.870
<i>Commencing counter measure.</i>

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.340
Wha?!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:40.380
<i>Blocking of attack code name:
Ultra Cyclone Chop, successful</i>

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:44.120
<i>Probability of victory, rising to 98%</i>

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.620
These guys know my method of fighting!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.210
All agents are in position!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.810
Commencing power supply
to the gate engine!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.540
We only have a single chance...

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:16.320
Target will arrive at the operation
point in 5 minutes, 32 seconds!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.450
Hell, I'll try anything now!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.130
<i>Attack pattern unknown!</i>
<i>No applicable data!</i>

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:31.500
DOUBLE ULTRA...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:35.170
...CYCLONE CHOP!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.840
That's my super-express dream train!!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.360
What's this?

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:02.530
That's dirty! Show yourself, cowardl!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:08.200
<i>You're foolish, human. This is what
happens when you trust only visual data.</i>

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.340
What did you say?!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:15.210
<i>Can't you understand?
This train itself is now my body!</i>

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.350
Th- That can't be!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.930
It's here!

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.470
Are you okay, Kaoru?!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.310
I'll give it a try!!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.540
At this rate, Mom and
Saemi will be killed!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.320
Commence operation!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.020
Distance, 1500 meters!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.160
Kaoru?!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:15.200
It's fast.
What's wrong, Princess Kaoru?!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.470
UKIYA!!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.190
Megane!
Roger dodger!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:45.430
W- What's happening?!
Look! It's slowing down!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.700
Yeah! It is!!
Saved! We'll be saved!!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.630
Kaoru?!

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.370
Now, Fei!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.210
You got it! KAIMEN GATE OPEN!!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.650
Explosive Panda Fire Ball!

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:05.080
It went smoothly!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.030
The passengers are safe!

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:10.030
Now for the engine!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:14.620
Yes, ma'am! I'll confuse
mister bullet train-robot...

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.100
...with my Gate of lllusion.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.510
Oh. my?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.150
Can't we catch up?!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.020
We can't go any faster!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.010
No!

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:52.140
<i>Even the Gate Keepers couldn't
stop my bullet train robot!</i>

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.760
<i>The greater portion of my
experiment is a success!</i>

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.740
Did you say experiment?!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:59.070
<i>Yes! This is only an experiment!</i>

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:03.810
<i>It will allow my invader mechanizing
divisions to fuse with any train!</i>

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:17.900
Now, human with the name of
Shun Ukiya, I will let you choose.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:20.400
Would you like to collide
with Tokyo Station...

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.990
...or would you prefer
to die here and now?

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.560
I won't let you kill Ukiya!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.130
Kaorul!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:35.410
You won't kill him!
Not while I'm watching!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.880
<i>The futility...</i>

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:47.450
<i>You can no longer use the gate engine,
so what can you hope to achieve?</i>

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:51.120
No! No! No! No!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:55.900
Ukiya taught me that if you
give up, you won't get anywhere!

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.700
Even if you know it's futile!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:03.640
KAORU PUNCH!!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.780
Give up, human!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:22.350
<i>Very well, I will rob you
of your life activity first.</i>

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:27.890
Kaorul!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.530
<i>Die!</i>

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.900
Damn it!!!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.370
Kikai Shogun!!

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.300
GATE...

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.350
...OPEN!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.560
Ukiyal!

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.190
Are you all right, Kaoru?!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.550
Yes! What about you,
Ukiya? Are you hurt?!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.160
Who, me? I'm fine! See, loo...

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.860
Ukiya!

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.460
But enough of that.
We have to stop this thing!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.680
I'll take care of it!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.170
<i>Interesting</i>

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:23.580
<i>A few of your kind in the past
have managed to harm me as well</i>

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.960
<i>Although...</i>

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.130
<i>Although I eventually tore
every one of them apart...</i>

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:33.690
<i>...limb fiom limb
and cast them into Hell</i>

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.590
Kaoru...

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.420
Ukiya!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.970
Unable to detect paranormal frequencies!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.170
<i>Precautionary warning lifted</i>
<i>Ms. Ochiai.</i>

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:14.710
<i>Field team, withdraw promptly
following safety confirmation.</i>

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.610
Command authority will be restored at 16:00 hours.
Yes, Commander. l'll put on the the special coffee right away.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:25.240
Ukiya! Ukiya!

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:27.840
Ukiyal!

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.680
Kaoru!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.290
I thought we were goners!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:37.020
We need to watch you more
closely, big brother!

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:42.030
The moment you leave home,
you're having casual sex...!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:46.240
You naughty girl... Shun! For a simple
shopping district lottery prize...

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.170
...this certainly had its share of thrills!

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.040
I keep telling you I'm not a cat!!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:50.970
M- Mo...

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:55.280
You must be Ukiya's mother!
I'm Kaoru Konoe.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:58.010
My name is Kaoru Konoe, Mother.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:01.820
Oh, my! What a pretty young lady!

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.560
O- Oh, please, Mother...!

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.120
Here.

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:11.720
What's this?

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:16.390
A paper cup. I got one for you.
You can flaunt it at school.

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:19.590
Hey, Rurippe! You want one, too?

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:22.730
It's a super express dream train
super special paper cup!!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.310
Idiot.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:43.620
First, the evil gate keeper and
Akuma Hakushaku from previous reports...

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.290
...and now the Kikai Shogun.
The invader executives...

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:50.820
...have never made a concentrated
appearance on one country.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:57.970
What do you suppose is about to
happen in our Japan, Commander?

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:11.120
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:14.990
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:19.960
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:23.340
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:25.470
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:30.640
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:33.980
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:38.610
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:43.480
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:48.120
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:54.900
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
